Here's the problem file for the task of putting the vase on the sofa:

```pddl
(define (problem put_vase_on_sofa)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    vase - object
    sofa - object
    sideTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot2 sideTable)
    (at-location vase sideTable)
    (not (inaction robot2))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location vase sofa)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.